## 2. Class Diagram

Entity classes match the ER tables. Service classes hold the rules (BR and FR). Controller classes only receive requests and call one service.

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class Category {
        +int categoryId
        +String name
        +String subcategory
    }
    class Asset {
        +int assetId
        +String tagNumber
        +String name
        +String description
        +int quantity
        +String location
        +Date purchaseDate
        +Decimal estValueAed
        +String condition
        +String materialType
        +AssetStatus status
        +boolean active
        +isAvailable() boolean
        +reserve(qty) void
        +deactivate() void
    }
    class AssetMedia {
        +int mediaId
        +String kind
        +String filePath
        +int sizeKb
        +isValidType() boolean
        +isValidSize() boolean
    }
